# Runtime image context for the Nexid executor.
# Tests and build tooling are available to Cloud Build but never copied into
# or sent as part of the production image context.
**

!.dockerignore
!package.json
!package-lock.json

!apps
!apps/executor
!apps/executor/package.json
!apps/executor/Dockerfile
!apps/executor/src
!apps/executor/src/**
